(6014463, 881890, 65858, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit underexposed, not a ton of blur in the bkg.  Next time, if you can separate the subject from the background with a little more distance, you''ll get more blur even if your camera doesn''t have a huge aperture.  i.e. Pick the flower and move it.  Good luck!</td>', 'Seems a bit underexposed, not a ton of blur in the bkg.  Next time, if you can separate the subject from the background with a little more distance, you''ll get more blur even if your camera doesn''t have a huge aperture.  i.e. Pick the flower and move it.  Good luck!', '2010-05-19 01:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6014465, 882769, 23061, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2010-05-19 01:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
