(6015982, 880833, 39679, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Bokeh, to my eye anyway, works best if it''s kept simple and this is a great example.  The background not only serves a nice backdrop to your subject but also lends depth and really brings attention to your subject.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Bokeh, to my eye anyway, works best if it''s kept simple and this is a great example.  The background not only serves a nice backdrop to your subject but also lends depth and really brings attention to your subject.', '2010-05-19 12:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
