(6017323, 882187, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the lights but the item in the front is a bit odd and uninteresting.</td>', 'I love the lights but the item in the front is a bit odd and uninteresting.', '2010-05-19 21:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017325, 883151, 96751, '<td valign="top">This would have done well in Zen :-)</td>', 'This would have done well in Zen :-)', '2010-05-19 21:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017326, 881890, 114225, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I don''t think this portrays good bokeh, the background is too visible and distracting. What I might suggest is getting lower so you are more even with the flower, instead of looking down upon it.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I don''t think this portrays good bokeh, the background is too visible and distracting. What I might suggest is getting lower so you are more even with the flower, instead of looking down upon it.', '2010-05-19 21:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017329, 882639, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. Instead of being distracting, I think the background is actually enhancing.</td>', 'This is pretty cool. Instead of being distracting, I think the background is actually enhancing.', '2010-05-19 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017331, 882284, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and well setup.</td>', 'Nice effect and well setup.', '2010-05-19 21:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017334, 883581, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like and dislike this photo at the same time. Really nice colors, but there is so much going on, that my eyes are darting all over the place.</td>', 'I like and dislike this photo at the same time. Really nice colors, but there is so much going on, that my eyes are darting all over the place.', '2010-05-19 21:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017335, 881973, 114225, '<td valign="top">You definitely got the bokeh right, but this image has a bit too much noise for me.</td>', 'You definitely got the bokeh right, but this image has a bit too much noise for me.', '2010-05-19 21:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017339, 881396, 114225, '<td valign="top">Definitely achieves boken, and a cute photo, but I think it could have done better if Murphy''s face was more in focus, and the background was a different color.</td>', 'Definitely achieves boken, and a cute photo, but I think it could have done better if Murphy''s face was more in focus, and the background was a different color.', '2010-05-19 21:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017342, 880855, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the color separation and lighting.</td>', 'Nice job with the color separation and lighting.', '2010-05-19 21:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017343, 880949, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  You must have one heck of a lens</td>', 'Oh wow.  You must have one heck of a lens', '2010-05-19 21:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017344, 882132, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice photo overall. I think I would have liked it slightly more if the background was a bit more pleasing (the white dots are somewhat overpowering).</td>', 'Nice photo overall. I think I would have liked it slightly more if the background was a bit more pleasing (the white dots are somewhat overpowering).', '2010-05-19 21:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017346, 882872, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here. It''s well composed and the bokeh is great.</td>', 'I like the idea here. It''s well composed and the bokeh is great.', '2010-05-19 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017347, 882940, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the bokeh on this</td>', 'Love the bokeh on this', '2010-05-19 21:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017348, 883611, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a really cool flower. I think the photo would have had a bit more pop if there was less stem shown.</td>', 'That''s a really cool flower. I think the photo would have had a bit more pop if there was less stem shown.', '2010-05-19 21:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017350, 883122, 96751, '<td valign="top">It''s easy to see why these guys are such a popular subject.  Love the autumnal tones and the backlight, making them look like little halos.</td>', 'It''s easy to see why these guys are such a popular subject.  Love the autumnal tones and the backlight, making them look like little halos.', '2010-05-19 21:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017351, 880737, 114225, '<td valign="top">This has the feeling over over-sharpening to me. I think that is not only making the subject look a bit off, but the background has really sharp edges too.</td>', 'This has the feeling over over-sharpening to me. I think that is not only making the subject look a bit off, but the background has really sharp edges too.', '2010-05-19 21:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017353, 881094, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like the floating effect you captured.</td>', 'I like the floating effect you captured.', '2010-05-19 21:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017355, 882485, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I really like how the flower fills a lot of the frame.</td>', 'Very cool. I really like how the flower fills a lot of the frame.', '2010-05-19 21:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017356, 883615, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a fun idea. I wonder what it would have looked like with a lens hood to block out the flare. I feel the flare may be reducing the overall photo contrast too much.</td>', 'This is a fun idea. I wonder what it would have looked like with a lens hood to block out the flare. I feel the flare may be reducing the overall photo contrast too much.', '2010-05-19 21:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017358, 882386, 96751, '<td valign="top">Well done take on a popular subject.  The highly colorful bokeh is a plus, as are the splattering droplets.  Should do very well.</td>', 'Well done take on a popular subject.  The highly colorful bokeh is a plus, as are the splattering droplets.  Should do very well.', '2010-05-19 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017359, 883490, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good job with getting the background blurred with a top down shot, that''s often difficult. Unfortunately, I think the DOF may be a bit too small. I would have liked to see the main flower be fully in focus.</td>', 'Good job with getting the background blurred with a top down shot, that''s often difficult. Unfortunately, I think the DOF may be a bit too small. I would have liked to see the main flower be fully in focus.', '2010-05-19 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017360, 882291, 11078, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! I gave you a 10 I just love it!</td>', 'Fabulous! I gave you a 10 I just love it!', '2010-05-19 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017362, 882848, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of colors.</td>', 'Nice contrast of colors.', '2010-05-19 21:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017365, 883252, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is just great.  Original and breathtaking clarity in the globe.  The flipped image seals the deal.  Front page.</td>', 'This is just great.  Original and breathtaking clarity in the globe.  The flipped image seals the deal.  Front page.', '2010-05-19 22:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017366, 880969, 114225, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the foreground being the bokeh part, but to me, there isn''t any part of this photo that is in focus.</td>', 'I don''t mind the foreground being the bokeh part, but to me, there isn''t any part of this photo that is in focus.', '2010-05-19 22:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017367, 882736, 11078, '<td valign="top">stunning 10</td>', 'stunning 10', '2010-05-19 22:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017369, 883322, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Great job getting the eye perfectly in focus.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Great job getting the eye perfectly in focus.', '2010-05-19 22:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017371, 883477, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this photo overall. I do feel that it''s a bit all over the place, my eyes can''t determine where to look.</td>', 'I like this photo overall. I do feel that it''s a bit all over the place, my eyes can''t determine where to look.', '2010-05-19 22:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017375, 882291, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo all around. Great focus, great lighting, great colors.</td>', 'Excellent photo all around. Great focus, great lighting, great colors.', '2010-05-19 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017376, 881747, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful!!  The circular bokeh is continued into infinity into the center.  The diagonal element adds a touch of geometry to balance the softness.  Brilliant.</td>', 'This is so beautiful!!  The circular bokeh is continued into infinity into the center.  The diagonal element adds a touch of geometry to balance the softness.  Brilliant.', '2010-05-19 22:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017380, 883122, 57447, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh.', '2010-05-19 22:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017381, 882861, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice relaxing scene.</td>', 'Nice relaxing scene.', '2010-05-19 22:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017383, 882926, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job with freezing the action.</td>', 'Great job with freezing the action.', '2010-05-19 22:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017384, 882555, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love pictures that make common objects look like exotic elements.  Well done.</td>', 'I love pictures that make common objects look like exotic elements.  Well done.', '2010-05-19 22:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017386, 882095, 57447, '<td valign="top">Compelling.  I like it.</td>', 'Compelling.  I like it.', '2010-05-19 22:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017387, 883122, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I''m having  hard time determining if the dandelion is completely in focus, but that may just be the nature of the weed.</td>', 'Nice idea. I''m having  hard time determining if the dandelion is completely in focus, but that may just be the nature of the weed.', '2010-05-19 22:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017389, 883180, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. I wonder what the subject is. After staring at it for a minute, I just cannot figure it out.</td>', 'Fun idea. I wonder what the subject is. After staring at it for a minute, I just cannot figure it out.', '2010-05-19 22:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017392, 882291, 57447, '<td valign="top">Hope to see this on the front page.</td>', 'Hope to see this on the front page.', '2010-05-19 22:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017395, 883202, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think this could have benefited from a little less noise in the flowers.</td>', 'I think this could have benefited from a little less noise in the flowers.', '2010-05-19 22:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017401, 882076, 114225, '<td valign="top">After all the flower shots, I almost thought this didn''t meet the challenge :)<br/>Nice photo!</td>', 'After all the flower shots, I almost thought this didn''t meet the challenge :)Nice photo!', '2010-05-19 22:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017404, 882364, 57447, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2010-05-19 22:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
