(6017932, 883101, 108580, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. A bit more clear view of the stamens (a higher angle) might have had more impact. Bokeh is clear and unobtrusive and complimentary. Hair/lint on central stamen a pity.</td>', 'Simple and elegant. A bit more clear view of the stamens (a higher angle) might have had more impact. Bokeh is clear and unobtrusive and complimentary. Hair/lint on central stamen a pity.', '2010-05-20 04:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
