(6017953, 883208, 108580, '<td valign="top">Your idea is good, the bokeh is appealing (bridge lights) but the foreground is wobbled (no tripod, hand held wobble) and this had a knock-on effect in the bokeh.</td>', 'Your idea is good, the bokeh is appealing (bridge lights) but the foreground is wobbled (no tripod, hand held wobble) and this had a knock-on effect in the bokeh.', '2010-05-20 04:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017957, 883092, 108580, '<td valign="top">Extremely appealing in its simplicity. This is a keeper.</td>', 'Extremely appealing in its simplicity. This is a keeper.', '2010-05-20 04:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017958, 880949, 117739, '<td valign="top">Good distinction between foreground and background, foreground is sharp (although nest in front seems very slightly sharper than mother bird''s eye) and bokeh is smooth and creamy. Bokeh of branch in lower right corner seems a tad too harsh and noisy, but could be due to bark texture. Color could be more balanced, seems to tend towards blue/purple. I like this picture very much! Added to my favorites :) Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Good distinction between foreground and background, foreground is sharp (although nest in front seems very slightly sharper than mother bird''s eye) and bokeh is smooth and creamy. Bokeh of branch in lower right corner seems a tad too harsh and noisy, but could be due to bark texture. Color could be more balanced, seems to tend towards blue/purple. I like this picture very much! Added to my favorites :) Thanks for sharing.', '2010-05-20 04:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017962, 883447, 108580, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus on subject, feathers look like Lyrebird? Bokeh is appealing.<br/>Lovely image.</td>', 'Crisp focus on subject, feathers look like Lyrebird? Bokeh is appealing.Lovely image.', '2010-05-20 05:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017963, 882565, 117739, '<td valign="top">Whiskers against creamy green bokeh! Facial features and ears are appropriately focused. Did you get the cat to wait for you while you took the shot? :) I like this very much. Added to my favorites!</td>', 'Whiskers against creamy green bokeh! Facial features and ears are appropriately focused. Did you get the cat to wait for you while you took the shot? :) I like this very much. Added to my favorites!', '2010-05-20 05:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017964, 882760, 108580, '<td valign="top">I think she''s a Gerenuk (Litocranius walleri) found in East Africa.<br/>I love the simple uncluttered background (bokeh) which makes the subject pop. You managed to control the exposure and get some detail out in the shaded area of her neck and face. Great image.</td>', 'I think she''s a Gerenuk (Litocranius walleri) found in East Africa.I love the simple uncluttered background (bokeh) which makes the subject pop. You managed to control the exposure and get some detail out in the shaded area of her neck and face. Great image.', '2010-05-20 05:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017966, 883286, 108580, '<td valign="top">It''s getting up my nose!<br/>Very little bokeh to speak of but perhaps enough. Subjective.<br/>Deep rich colour but I would prefer a bit more DOF on the surrounding petals.</td>', 'It''s getting up my nose!Very little bokeh to speak of but perhaps enough. Subjective.Deep rich colour but I would prefer a bit more DOF on the surrounding petals.', '2010-05-20 05:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017968, 881367, 117739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful closeup, beautiful dragonfly and amazingly <i>sharp</i> leaf! ;) Not forgetting the nice separation between the subject and the creamy smooth bokeh. Cheers.</td>', 'Beautiful closeup, beautiful dragonfly and amazingly sharp leaf! ;) Not forgetting the nice separation between the subject and the creamy smooth bokeh. Cheers.', '2010-05-20 05:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
