(6017976, 882327, 117739, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail didn''t look like much for a bokeh... but when I clicked on this pic, WOW! Beautiful baby in wonderland. The flare on the bottom turned out amazing as well. Cheers!</td>', 'The thumbnail didn''t look like much for a bokeh... but when I clicked on this pic, WOW! Beautiful baby in wonderland. The flare on the bottom turned out amazing as well. Cheers!', '2010-05-20 05:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
