(6017981, 882534, 108580, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the blurred shot that is being discussed in the forum. Yes there''s bokeh but the taxi is definitely wobbled and I personally believe it needs to be in focus to have mass appeal. Note I said \"Mass\" appeal. Doesn''t mean it will will not appeal to others. I cannot vote on this as I feel it would be unfair but perhaps a 5.</td>', 'Perhaps the blurred shot that is being discussed in the forum. Yes there''s bokeh but the taxi is definitely wobbled and I personally believe it needs to be in focus to have mass appeal. Note I said \"Mass\" appeal. Doesn''t mean it will will not appeal to others. I cannot vote on this as I feel it would be unfair but perhaps a 5.', '2010-05-20 05:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
