(6018030, 881023, 117739, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t see any bokeh in the foregroud... The closest tree I can see seems to be in perfect focus. The blur in the water reflection looks more like a result of ripples on the water surface... A nice image anyway if not for the bokeh challenge.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t see any bokeh in the foregroud... The closest tree I can see seems to be in perfect focus. The blur in the water reflection looks more like a result of ripples on the water surface... A nice image anyway if not for the bokeh challenge.', '2010-05-20 06:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
