(6019927, 881548, 93756, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on bokeh where we see it through the subject, not just behind or filling the frame. Creative. The multi-colored affect is great. The clarity of the drops towards the left of center is spot-on but you lose focus in the middle/right of middle. The red portion of the leaf is a little too murky considering that is the largest area of color in the photo. Maybe you could have cropped some of the right portion of the photo to make it a stronger overall look.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on bokeh where we see it through the subject, not just behind or filling the frame. Creative. The multi-colored affect is great. The clarity of the drops towards the left of center is spot-on but you lose focus in the middle/right of middle. The red portion of the leaf is a little too murky considering that is the largest area of color in the photo. Maybe you could have cropped some of the right portion of the photo to make it a stronger overall look.', '2010-05-21 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6019929, 881747, 93756, '<td valign="top">LOVE the centered composition - something we forget to do when the subject merits it. Different take on bokeh really frames the subject. Good job.</td>', 'LOVE the centered composition - something we forget to do when the subject merits it. Different take on bokeh really frames the subject. Good job.', '2010-05-21 11:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
