(6020667, 883488, 115307, '<td valign="top">So, every time I come back to this picture, the title gets that stupid rap song "Shawty''s like a symphony in my head" song stuck in my head, which is awful. Buuuuuut, I forgive you because this is a truly breathtaking and beautiful picture. And as I have already mentioned, it keeps me coming back to view it over and over :-) 9</td>', 'So, every time I come back to this picture, the title gets that stupid rap song "Shawty''s like a symphony in my head" song stuck in my head, which is awful. Buuuuuut, I forgive you because this is a truly breathtaking and beautiful picture. And as I have already mentioned, it keeps me coming back to view it over and over :-) 9', '2010-05-22 02:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6020668, 882053, 115307, '<td valign="top">This picture has grown on me. At first when I saw it I thought it was pretty good, but now I am starting to like it more and more. This was beautifully done, and I can''t help but wonder how you managed such a small depth of focus with a fairly wide angle. I couldn''t do that with my lenses, the background wouldn''t be blurry enough! Though, you might have some much nicer i.e expensive glass than I do. For once, a photo with a border that I don''t mind! I could see this picture hanging on my wall. 8</td>', 'This picture has grown on me. At first when I saw it I thought it was pretty good, but now I am starting to like it more and more. This was beautifully done, and I can''t help but wonder how you managed such a small depth of focus with a fairly wide angle. I couldn''t do that with my lenses, the background wouldn''t be blurry enough! Though, you might have some much nicer i.e expensive glass than I do. For once, a photo with a border that I don''t mind! I could see this picture hanging on my wall. 8', '2010-05-22 03:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6020669, 881023, 115307, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t really consider the reflection of water as bokeh. My definition of bokeh is blur that is created via camera technique for instance zoom or wide open aperture, not via slight blur created in nature.<br/>Its a nice image, and I like the green on the left contrasting with the dead branches. But this just doesn''t meet the challenge for me.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t really consider the reflection of water as bokeh. My definition of bokeh is blur that is created via camera technique for instance zoom or wide open aperture, not via slight blur created in nature.Its a nice image, and I like the green on the left contrasting with the dead branches. But this just doesn''t meet the challenge for me.', '2010-05-22 03:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6020671, 883500, 115307, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any bokeh here at all. Sorry but this doesn''t match the challenge for me. It is a lovely photo anyways.</td>', 'I don''t see any bokeh here at all. Sorry but this doesn''t match the challenge for me. It is a lovely photo anyways.', '2010-05-22 03:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6020672, 883293, 115307, '<td valign="top">I wish I couldn''t see your finger holding this (or what I interpret to be your finger). Otherwise this is a beautiful image.</td>', 'I wish I couldn''t see your finger holding this (or what I interpret to be your finger). Otherwise this is a beautiful image.', '2010-05-22 03:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6020673, 881747, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow this is fantastic in its simplicity and its glorious colors. Very well done!</td>', 'Wow this is fantastic in its simplicity and its glorious colors. Very well done!', '2010-05-22 03:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6020674, 882534, 115307, '<td valign="top">If that first car was in focus, this would be a fantastic image. What I am missing here is an infocus subject to really strengthen the image.</td>', 'If that first car was in focus, this would be a fantastic image. What I am missing here is an infocus subject to really strengthen the image.', '2010-05-22 03:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6020676, 881627, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject, but the bokeh is rather bland. I am conflicted on voting on this image probably more so than any other image in this challenge, because I just can''t decide which should weigh more heavily for me the subject or the bokeh (i.e. the challenge theme)</td>', 'Beautiful subject, but the bokeh is rather bland. I am conflicted on voting on this image probably more so than any other image in this challenge, because I just can''t decide which should weigh more heavily for me the subject or the bokeh (i.e. the challenge theme)', '2010-05-22 03:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6020740, 883092, 93421, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2010-05-22 07:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
