(6021200, 882815, 113801, '<td valign="top">oooo hard to vote good on this one since I am terrified of spiders! Is that its real color? but really I think it is a superb shot so I will give it a good vote :)</td>', 'oooo hard to vote good on this one since I am terrified of spiders! Is that its real color? but really I think it is a superb shot so I will give it a good vote :)', '2010-05-22 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6021202, 881674, 111773, '<td valign="top">Those slashes are a little distracting. That being said, this is a nice shot.</td>', 'Those slashes are a little distracting. That being said, this is a nice shot.', '2010-05-22 18:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6021206, 882739, 111773, '<td valign="top">Not a bad pic, but would like to see more blur in the background, given the nature of this challenge.</td>', 'Not a bad pic, but would like to see more blur in the background, given the nature of this challenge.', '2010-05-22 18:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6021207, 883498, 113801, '<td valign="top">LOL cool!</td>', 'LOL cool!', '2010-05-22 18:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6021208, 883488, 61788, '<td valign="top">I love these small buds and "hair" backlighted, and very much colors of them matching with background and bokeh there - I think those areas are strong part of the image. But I don''t like green leaves - their color is so distracting from the beauty of other parts in the image - even though I understand it is what nature created. I don''t like even big flower. I think if you have focused on buds and background, opportunities to make exceptional artwork were better. This is the case when people say "you show what nature created" but you can "create your own". Sorry for "intrusion" :)</td>', 'I love these small buds and "hair" backlighted, and very much colors of them matching with background and bokeh there - I think those areas are strong part of the image. But I don''t like green leaves - their color is so distracting from the beauty of other parts in the image - even though I understand it is what nature created. I don''t like even big flower. I think if you have focused on buds and background, opportunities to make exceptional artwork were better. This is the case when people say "you show what nature created" but you can "create your own". Sorry for "intrusion" :)', '2010-05-22 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6021209, 881484, 113801, '<td valign="top">Thats art! Good job!</td>', 'Thats art! Good job!', '2010-05-22 18:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6021210, 883639, 113801, '<td valign="top">cute! the eyes look like blueberries :)</td>', 'cute! the eyes look like blueberries :)', '2010-05-22 18:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
