(6022158, 883092, 61788, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what is this and how is this produced. And I don''t really care! Because this is beautiful!</td>', 'I don''t know what is this and how is this produced. And I don''t really care! Because this is beautiful!', '2010-05-23 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6022159, 882326, 61788, '<td valign="top">Very nice image - I like soft palette and gradual change of color from green on the bottom to whatever on the top. Agree this thin/tenuous grass (not sure - is it because there are only few of them, or "contrasting" their structure to blurry backgound, or whatever else) creates impression of fragility.  Thinking what can make this image stronger, I think cropping right part (quarter or up to third of the image) can help focus only on these 2-3 stems, will make lines closer to be diagonal and create more dynamic to the image. There still be enough bokeh in the image if that is a concern :) Good work!</td>', 'Very nice image - I like soft palette and gradual change of color from green on the bottom to whatever on the top. Agree this thin/tenuous grass (not sure - is it because there are only few of them, or "contrasting" their structure to blurry backgound, or whatever else) creates impression of fragility.  Thinking what can make this image stronger, I think cropping right part (quarter or up to third of the image) can help focus only on these 2-3 stems, will make lines closer to be diagonal and create more dynamic to the image. There still be enough bokeh in the image if that is a concern :) Good work!', '2010-05-23 17:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
