(6024583, 882291, 115307, '<td valign="top">Holy Smokes! This is breathtaking!<br/>I give very few images instant 10s, generally I give them 8s or 9s, and later realize that they deserve a higher score.<br/>This is one of those rare occasions where I crank it out right away. Stunning!</td>', 'Holy Smokes! This is breathtaking!I give very few images instant 10s, generally I give them 8s or 9s, and later realize that they deserve a higher score.This is one of those rare occasions where I crank it out right away. Stunning!', '2010-05-24 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6024587, 883094, 115307, '<td valign="top">This seagull is in great focus. However, there are two reasons why I cannot give this a good score.<br/>1, the bokeh in the background is actually quite distracting and pulls attention away from the bird.<br/>2, the eye of the seagull is not visible which is very important to me.<br/>If the eye was visible, I might be able to forgive the house. I think this is just one of those examples of a technically very well done photo doing poorly simply based on being captured a second too late and from a slightly bad angle. 4</td>', 'This seagull is in great focus. However, there are two reasons why I cannot give this a good score.1, the bokeh in the background is actually quite distracting and pulls attention away from the bird.2, the eye of the seagull is not visible which is very important to me.If the eye was visible, I might be able to forgive the house. I think this is just one of those examples of a technically very well done photo doing poorly simply based on being captured a second too late and from a slightly bad angle. 4', '2010-05-24 17:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
