(6030147, 882291, 58452, '<td valign="top">Tail, smail, you could have just wrangled him around some more and got the entire fly parallel to the sensor.  But heck, I don''t know if I could have stood that much perfection. I guess some of the fake drop criers have never hunted winged insects in the morning dew. I echo all the great comments you''ve received on this image. It really gives me a great feeling when I view it. With one exception: The %*&amp;%ing watermark!!!!! It''s like looking at the frigging Mona Lisa that someone smeared a dog turd on. Wish I''d have seen this one during the voting.</td>', 'Tail, smail, you could have just wrangled him around some more and got the entire fly parallel to the sensor.  But heck, I don''t know if I could have stood that much perfection. I guess some of the fake drop criers have never hunted winged insects in the morning dew. I echo all the great comments you''ve received on this image. It really gives me a great feeling when I view it. With one exception: The %*&%ing watermark!!!!! It''s like looking at the frigging Mona Lisa that someone smeared a dog turd on. Wish I''d have seen this one during the voting.', '2010-05-27 19:51:05.000000', NULL, 0),
