(6030403, 883225, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like what you did with this one.  The red and the back make a nice contrast.  I like all the colored lights.  I think the large aperture (which gave the nice bokeh) hurt you with the focus on the hat.  If the stars had been sharper they would have stood out more.  I am also not sure about the angle.  Perhaps shooting from a lower angle would have had less hat brim and more of the part with the stars.</td>', 'I like what you did with this one.  The red and the back make a nice contrast.  I like all the colored lights.  I think the large aperture (which gave the nice bokeh) hurt you with the focus on the hat.  If the stars had been sharper they would have stood out more.  I am also not sure about the angle.  Perhaps shooting from a lower angle would have had less hat brim and more of the part with the stars.', '2010-05-28 00:04:05.000000', NULL, 0),
