(6032635, 881250, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey sandy .. i came visiting .. !!<br/>wondered if you''d entered any challenges lately so clicked on Bokeh VI .. <br/>well .. you''ve really got to wonder .. its the most amazing photograph .. i would imagine that a shot like this would be as hard as getting insects to pose for you .. !! .. and yet you got so many substandard votes .. <br/>i have our budgie on my shoulder as i''m typing this and he just said ''oh my god'' .. sorry for the profanity .. !!<br/>but that''s just wot i was thinking .. i''d usually write ''oh my gosh'' in dpc just so i dont offend anyone, but unfortunately the bird doesnt have my scruples .. !!<br/>anyway .. CONGRATULATIONS on a blue ribbon image .. the fact that you got the bokeh and the bird in focus in flight is really amazing .. <br/>hope your business and life is going really well .. <br/>much love .. xxx<br/>ps .. i put a link to my site on my profile page on saturday .. took me ages to figure out the codes so that the pic was the link .. but the site is better now .. we changed the format so the pics would open larger .. i''ve got a stack of other stuff going on as well .. <br/>maybe i should write you a proper email rather than a post .. lol .. <br/>xxx</td>', 'hey sandy .. i came visiting .. !!wondered if you''d entered any challenges lately so clicked on Bokeh VI .. well .. you''ve really got to wonder .. its the most amazing photograph .. i would imagine that a shot like this would be as hard as getting insects to pose for you .. !! .. and yet you got so many substandard votes .. i have our budgie on my shoulder as i''m typing this and he just said ''oh my god'' .. sorry for the profanity .. !!but that''s just wot i was thinking .. i''d usually write ''oh my gosh'' in dpc just so i dont offend anyone, but unfortunately the bird doesnt have my scruples .. !!anyway .. CONGRATULATIONS on a blue ribbon image .. the fact that you got the bokeh and the bird in focus in flight is really amazing .. hope your business and life is going really well .. much love .. xxxps .. i put a link to my site on my profile page on saturday .. took me ages to figure out the codes so that the pic was the link .. but the site is better now .. we changed the format so the pics would open larger .. i''ve got a stack of other stuff going on as well .. maybe i should write you a proper email rather than a post .. lol .. xxx', '2010-05-30 19:28:35.000000', NULL, 0),
