(6838150, 881665, 108580, '<td valign="top">There are a number of backlit images of late, h2 (Oliver did one in the recent July 2012 FS) and I comment on them if they cross my path. This is beautiful. The rimlight and the golden hour colour is stunning. I gave it a 7. 8 if the little grass stalk bottom right was held back out of the shot :P<br/>I am tempted to get that Nikkor 60mm Macro especially for the DX bodies but I think I''ll settle for the newer Nikkor 100mm f/2.8 VRII...now where''s the nearest liquor store and my sawn off shotgun...?</td>', 'There are a number of backlit images of late, h2 (Oliver did one in the recent July 2012 FS) and I comment on them if they cross my path. This is beautiful. The rimlight and the golden hour colour is stunning. I gave it a 7. 8 if the little grass stalk bottom right was held back out of the shot :PI am tempted to get that Nikkor 60mm Macro especially for the DX bodies but I think I''ll settle for the newer Nikkor 100mm f/2.8 VRII...now where''s the nearest liquor store and my sawn off shotgun...?', '2012-08-08 17:11:16.000000', NULL, 0),
